<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR"><head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Playlists do Spotify — Índice Alfabético</title>
<style id="app-style">
:root {
  --background: #121212;
  --surface: #181818;
  --surface-hover: #222;
  --border: #2c2c2c;
  --text: #fff;
  --muted: #aaa;
  --green: #1ed760;
  --green-dark: #169c46;
}

* {
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

html {
  scroll-behavior: smooth;
  scroll-padding-top: 190px;
}

body {
  margin: 0;
  background: var(--background);
  color: var(--text);
  font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
}

header {
  position: sticky;
  top: 0;
  z-index: 20;
  background: rgba(18, 18, 18, .97);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
}

.header-inner,
main {
  width: min(1100px, 100%);
  margin: 0 auto;
}

.header-inner {
  padding: 18px 18px 12px;
}

.top-line {
  display: flex;
  gap: 16px;
  align-items: flex-end;
  justify-content: space-between;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}

h1 {
  margin: 0 0 4px;
  font-size: clamp(25px, 4vw, 38px);
}

.subtitle {
  margin: 0;
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 14px;
}

.search {
  width: min(360px, 100%);
  min-height: 42px;
  padding: 10px 15px;
  border: 1px solid #444;
  border-radius: 999px;
  background: #fff;
  color: #111;
  font-size: 15px;
  outline: none;
}

.search:focus {
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(30, 215, 96, .28);
}

.alphabet {
  display: flex;
  gap: 6px;
  overflow-x: auto;
  padding: 1px 0 6px;
  scrollbar-width: thin;
}

.alphabet a {
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  min-width: 32px;
  height: 32px;
  padding: 0 9px;
  border: 1px solid #3a3a3a;
  border-radius: 8px;
  background: #202020;
  color: var(--text);
  text-decoration: none;
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 14px;
}

.alphabet a:hover {
  border-color: var(--green);
  color: var(--green);
}

main {
  padding: 12px 18px 40px;
}

.playlist-row {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 44px minmax(180px, 1fr) auto;
  gap: 12px;
  align-items: center;
  min-height: 62px;
  padding: 9px 12px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  background: var(--surface);
}

.playlist-row:first-child {
  border-radius: 10px 10px 0 0;
}

.playlist-row:last-of-type {
  border-radius: 0 0 10px 10px;
}

.playlist-row:hover {
  background: var(--surface-hover);
}

.number {
  color: var(--muted);
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  text-align: center;
}

.title-line {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 8px;
}

.playlist-name {
  font-size: 16px;
  font-weight: 700;
}

.badge {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  min-height: 24px;
  padding: 3px 8px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(30, 215, 96, .55);
  border-radius: 999px;
  color: var(--green);
  background: rgba(30, 215, 96, .08);
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 700;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.actions {
  display: flex;
  gap: 8px;
  justify-content: flex-end;
}

.button {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  min-height: 38px;
  padding: 8px 12px;
  border-radius: 999px;
  text-decoration: none;
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 700;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.button.web {
  border: 1px solid #4b4b4b;
  color: #fff;
  background: #292929;
}

.button.web:hover {
  background: #383838;
}

.button.app {
  color: #061b0d;
  background: var(--green);
}

.button.app:hover {
  background: #35e575;
}

.empty {
  display: none;
  padding: 42px 10px;
  text-align: center;
  color: var(--muted);
}

.note {
  margin: 14px 2px 0;
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 12px;
  line-height: 1.5;
}

@media (max-width: 780px) {
  html {
    scroll-padding-top: 235px;
  }

  .top-line {
    align-items: stretch;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .search {
    width: 100%;
  }

  .playlist-row {
    grid-template-columns: 36px minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 11px 9px;
  }

  .actions {
    grid-column: 2;
    justify-content: flex-start;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .button {
    min-height: 35px;
    padding: 7px 10px;
  }
}

/* ===== Adicionar / editar / salvar ===== */
[hidden] {
  display: none !important;
}

.controls {
  display: flex;
  flex: 0 1 640px;
  flex-wrap: nowrap;
  gap: 8px;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: flex-end;
}

.controls .search {
  flex: 1 1 200px;
  width: auto;
  max-width: 360px;
}

.tool-btn {
  min-height: 42px;
  padding: 0 16px;
  border: 1px solid #4b4b4b;
  border-radius: 999px;
  background: #292929;
  color: #fff;
  font: 700 14px Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
  white-space: nowrap;
  cursor: pointer;
}

.tool-btn:hover {
  background: #383838;
}

.tool-btn.primary {
  border-color: transparent;
  background: var(--green);
  color: #061b0d;
}

.tool-btn.primary:hover {
  background: #35e575;
}

.tool-btn.save {
  border-color: var(--green);
  background: rgba(30, 215, 96, .1);
  color: var(--green);
}

.tool-btn.save:hover {
  background: rgba(30, 215, 96, .2);
}

.tool-btn[aria-pressed="true"] {
  border-color: #fff;
}

.pill {
  display: inline-block;
  min-width: 20px;
  margin-left: 6px;
  padding: 1px 6px;
  border-radius: 999px;
  background: var(--green);
  color: #061b0d;
  font-size: 12px;
}

button:focus-visible,
a:focus-visible,
input:focus-visible {
  outline: 2px solid var(--green);
  outline-offset: 2px;
}

.row-tools {
  display: none;
  gap: 6px;
}

body.editing .row-tools {
  display: inline-flex;
}

.icon-btn {
  width: 38px;
  height: 38px;
  border: 1px solid #4b4b4b;
  border-radius: 999px;
  background: #292929;
  color: #fff;
  font-size: 15px;
  line-height: 1;
  cursor: pointer;
}

.icon-btn:hover {
  background: #383838;
}

.icon-btn.danger:hover {
  border-color: #e5484d;
  color: #ff6b6b;
}

@keyframes row-flash {
  from { background: rgba(30, 215, 96, .25); }
  to   { background: var(--surface); }
}

.playlist-row.flash {
  animation: row-flash 1.8s ease-out;
}

#editor {
  width: min(440px, calc(100% - 32px));
  padding: 0;
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 14px;
  background: var(--surface);
  color: var(--text);
}

#editor::backdrop {
  background: rgba(0, 0, 0, .65);
}

.editor-body {
  display: grid;
  gap: 14px;
  padding: 20px;
}

.editor-body h2 {
  margin: 0;
  font-size: 20px;
}

.field {
  display: grid;
  gap: 6px;
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 700;
}

.field small {
  font-weight: 400;
}

.field input {
  min-height: 42px;
  padding: 10px 12px;
  border: 1px solid #444;
  border-radius: 8px;
  background: var(--background);
  color: var(--text);
  font-size: 15px;
}

.field input:focus {
  border-color: var(--green);
  outline: none;
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(30, 215, 96, .28);
}

.form-msg {
  min-height: 18px;
  margin: 0;
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 13px;
  line-height: 1.4;
}

.form-msg.error {
  color: #ff6b6b;
}

.form-actions {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: flex-end;
  gap: 8px;
}

.form-actions .tool-btn:disabled {
  opacity: .45;
  cursor: not-allowed;
}

.toast {
  position: fixed;
  left: 50%;
  bottom: calc(22px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px));
  z-index: 50;
  max-width: calc(100% - 32px);
  padding: 10px 16px;
  border-radius: 999px;
  background: #fff;
  color: #111;
  font-size: 14px;
  font-weight: 700;
  text-align: center;
  opacity: 0;
  transform: translate(-50%, 16px);
  transition: opacity .2s, transform .2s;
  pointer-events: none;
}

.toast.show {
  opacity: 1;
  transform: translate(-50%, 0);
}

@media (max-width: 780px) {
  .controls {
    flex: 1 1 auto;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: stretch;
  }

  .controls .search {
    flex: 1 1 100%;
    max-width: none;
  }

  .tool-btn {
    flex: 1 1 auto;
  }
}

@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  html {
    scroll-behavior: auto;
  }

  .toast {
    transition: none;
  }

  .playlist-row.flash {
    animation: none;
    outline: 2px solid var(--green);
  }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>
<header>
  <div class="header-inner">
    <div class="top-line">
      <div>
        <h1>Playlists do Spotify</h1>
        <p class="subtitle" id="count">96 playlists em ordem alfabética</p>
      </div>

      <div class="controls">
        <input id="search" class="search" type="search" placeholder="Buscar artista ou playlist..." autocomplete="off">
        <button type="button" id="add-btn" class="tool-btn primary">+ Adicionar</button>
        <button type="button" id="edit-btn" class="tool-btn" aria-pressed="false">Editar lista</button>
        <button type="button" id="save-btn" class="tool-btn save" hidden="">Salvar arquivo</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <nav id="alphabet" class="alphabet" aria-label="Índice alfabético"></nav>
  </div>
</header>

<main>
  <section id="playlist-list"></section>

  <div id="empty" class="empty">Nenhuma playlist encontrada.</div>

  <p class="note">
    Pra adicionar: copie o link da playlist no Spotify e cole (Ctrl+V) em qualquer lugar desta página.
    Depois clique em “Salvar arquivo” pra gravar a lista nova no .htm.<br>
    “Abrir no Spotify” usa o navegador nesta mesma página.
    “Abrir no aplicativo” tenta abrir o programa do Spotify instalado no computador ou celular.
  </p>
</main>

<dialog id="editor" aria-labelledby="editor-title">
  <form id="editor-form" class="editor-body" novalidate="">
    <h2 id="editor-title">Adicionar playlist</h2>

    <label class="field">
      Link do Spotify
      <input id="f-link" type="url" placeholder="https://open.spotify.com/playlist/..." autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false">
    </label>

    <label class="field">
      Nome do artista
      <input id="f-nome" type="text" autocomplete="off">
    </label>

    <label class="field">
      <span>Etiqueta <small>(opcional, ex.: Ao Vivo)</small></span>
      <input id="f-tag" type="text" autocomplete="off">
    </label>

    <p id="f-msg" class="form-msg" aria-live="polite"></p>

    <div class="form-actions">
      <button type="button" id="f-cancel" class="tool-btn">Cancelar</button>
      <button type="submit" id="f-ok" class="tool-btn primary">Adicionar</button>
    </div>
  </form>
</dialog>

<div id="toast" class="toast" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>

